  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "switch to ranged mode dealing damage and stun, or melee mode dealing true damage",
    "skill1": "mark an enemy, prioritizing attacks on them and absorbing their energy",
    "skill2": "mode-based: damage and haste reduction, or multi-hit attack",
    "skill3": "ATK grows with each non-summoned enemy defeated",
    "skill4": "marked enemy defeat increases movement speed and haste",
    "skill5": "deal bonus damage to marked enemy"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Vala]] marks an enemy and prioritizes it, absorbing Energy on each focused attack to starve its rotation. Her ultimate switches between ranged stun and melee true-damage modes as positioning changes. Mode-based skills either reduce enemy Haste or deliver multi-hit burst for flexible offense. ATK grows with each non-summoned enemy defeated, and a marked kill boosts movement speed and Haste. [[Vala]] excels at focused pressure on priority carries, but mark-immune or stealth-heavy lines deny much of her Energy drain and mode switching.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Vala]] marks the farthest unit at battle start, drains its Energy, and flips between ranged stun and melee true-damage modes as she relocates. After a marked kill she becomes untargetable, so do not dump burst into that window. Use lasting coverage like [[Shemira]] or [[Frieren]], catch the stun-mode ultimate with [[Lily May]], and inhibit the marked carry with [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Bonnie]] or [[Evie]]. Race the drain cycle with [[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Thador]] or [[Hugin]]."
}
